uently  in  in march april there was a big outbreak  caused by delta virus and many of our  staff members also got infected in fact  in 2020 11 had got infected  and in 2021  by delta virus  11 and one  12 got infected one person had got  infected and recovered from 2020 but 11  new persons got infected  they were also vaccinated so some of  them had taken one dose and some had  taken two doses and some had not taken  any dose so when we tested them we found  that using  s1 s2  12 have more than 400  arbitrary units per ml but when we  tested with trimeric we found that  trimeric was much more sensitive  and  12 of them had more than 2 000  binding antibody units per ml but many  of them had higher titles  who has now made antibodies standard  antibody test available so that the  binding unit could be converted  arbitrary units could be converted into  binding antibody unit  when we looked at individual responses  against f1 s2 and trimeric antibodies we  found that not everybody  responded by producing high antibodies  and this was especially in  persons who have older age group  those who had vaccines had  medium titer of antibodies  but those who had had  vaccination as well as suffered from  infection  either  in 2020  or  2021 by the delta variant and very high  titles of antibiotics  even one dose and infection  or infection and one dose produce very  high tight  when we added neutralizing antibodies  we find that  trimeric antibodies and utilizing  antibodies would  would go there was consistency  in very high trimeric antibodies and  neutralizing antibodies and so trimeric  antibodies could act as surrogate  markers for neutralization  but those persons as i said  if a person has had infection and then  taken vaccination or vaccination and  then get got infected  they had very high cycles even one dose  was enough  with along with vaccination to produce  high antibodies  this was also reported by tremecker from  new york who found that  if we investigated between persons who  had pre-existing antibodies and then  vaccinated after one dose  those persons produced much higher  titles  than those who had not had antibodies  and that remained after sucking those  also  in fact those who were already  vaccinated or infected and got two  vaccinations had more side effects  than titus  this is then been reported as covet 19  hybrid immunity so natural infection  itself  is gives protection from reinfection  from the same virus  unless a mutant  arises a variant  emerges but  infection followed by vaccination will  provide  much better hybrid ability  even in vaccination initially homologous  vaccinations were insisted upon by all  by all regulatory authorities but  sometimes by mistake or sometimes by  design as you know sputnik vaccination  already has two different human  adenoviruses  while kovi shield which is the vaccine  used in india  was interchanged by mistake by  co-vaccine and they got good results  the same has been reported in europe  with oxford astrazeneca followed by  fighters  or with modern  so heterologous waxy seems to be  giving good results  but muladin reported that not everybody  produces high antibodies and they found  that persons who were  elderly had  both  less  igg antibodies  and neutralizing antibodies  from qatar the reports came  that after the vaccination  there was a decrease  in protection against infection  but protection against severe infection  or death  continued at high level  it was also  shown  that  in transplant patients if a third dose  of the vaccination is given they have  high immune response  from israel it has been reported  that a third dose to those  whose  tigers were falling would give them good  immunity  and protect them  recently an ongoing study has been  reported this is the octave trial which  is observational cohort trials  t cells antibodies and  vaccine applications charge kobe 2  from  from scotland  and this has  has taken  patients who are immunocompromised 