e for  vaccination at this point in time  and it appears that 20 percent has been  fully vaccinated and many more about  71.71 billion have  received at least one dose  at this moment  booster dose has not been allowed or  permitted in india  thank you so much  now our next question coming in  do you have some evidence about the  performance of trimeric s igg assay with  the delta variant  yes uh i showed you the data that i had  with our own staff members who  contacted the infection in  may  in april and may of this year they had  very high titles after they have  recovered  many of them have been vaccinated some  of them were not vaccinated  but they produced high title of  antibodies and once they have high  titles of trimeric antibodies they also  have high titles of neutralizing  antibodies so neutralizing antibodies is  a manual process by doing elisa while  climatic is an automated chemilumiscence  process which is faster and better  and  more hands-off so it is suitable for  high throughput and  high titles of antibodies were found in  those persons  who had suffered from death  thank you so much dr ratten and i want  to thank our audience for these great  questions we have one more question  coming in dr ratan  literature is reporting that there are  certain groups of amino compromised  patients for example hiv  and patients that do not just differ in  their serological response to  vaccinations from the healthy controls  would it make more sense to first  measure their serological response after  vaccination prior to giving them an  additional vaccine dose what are your  thoughts about that  uh unfortunately in our group we have  not had anybody who has hiv positive  so  i don't have any data on hiv  but on the other hand as i have  indicated that those who had infection  in 2020  and got one back one dose had high types  of antibodies so on one hand we say  that there is shortage of vaccination on  the other hand we are giving a second  dose to those who